---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Section id="about" eyebrow="01 / about" title="About">
  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
    <div class="sm:col-span-2 space-y-5 text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed text-lg">
      <p>
        I'm {site.name.split(' ')[0]}, a full-stack developer with a focus on TypeScript,
        Node.js, and modern frontends. I build resilient backends, accessible UIs, and
        SEO-optimized sites that load fast and stay maintainable.
      </p>
      <p>
        Recent work has spanned SSR migrations, GraphQL APIs, real-time collaboration features,
        and CI/CD pipelines. I care about <span class="text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">measurable performance</span>,
        clean abstractions, and shipping things people actually use.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of code, I read about distributed systems, contribute to open source, and
        maintain a few side projects you'll find below.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="space-y-4 text-sm">
      <div>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-1">Location</p>
        <p>{site.location}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-1">Email</p>
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-accent)] transition-colors break-all">{site.email}</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-1">Status</p>
        <p>Open to roles & contracts</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Section>
